* The day of the week by Zeller's rule: 0 is Saturday, 1 Sunday ... 6 Friday.
* January and February count as months 13 and 14 of the year before.
1.1 Set M = m.
1.2 Set Y = y.
1.3 Set M = m+12 if m < 3.
1.4 Set Y = y-1 if m < 3.
1.5 Set K = Y - 100·ip(Y/100).
1.6 Set J = ip(Y/100).
1.7 Set h = d + ip[13·(M+1)/5] + K + ip(K/4) + ip(J/4) + 5·J.
1.8 Set h = h - 7·ip(h/7).
1.9 Type m, d, y, h in form 1.
Form 1:
__/__/____ is day _

* The JOSS film was made on 21 March 1964, a Saturday.
Set m = 3.
Set d = 21.
Set y = 1964.
Do part 1.
 3/21/1964 is day 0
* P-3131 was typed at a console on 28 April 1965, a Wednesday.
Set m = 4.
Set d = 28.
Set y = 1965.
Do part 1.
 4/28/1965 is day 4
